<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #29543.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4329766971" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29543" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29543/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29543">#29543</a>.</p>]]></content>
